# Which VIT services to redeploy.
# Edit this file (or pass --services on the CLI / workflow_dispatch input).
#
# Allowed values (comma-separated):
#   api              – Nest API (vit-api)
#   system-admin     – Platform admin (vit-platform)
#   tenant-admin     – Tenant admin (vit-admin)
#   gps-ingest       – Private TCP GPS ingest sidecar
#   all              – api + system-admin + tenant-admin + gps-ingest
#
# Aliases accepted by redeploy.sh / the workflow:
#   vit-api, api
#   platform, platform-admin, vit-platform, system-admin
#   tenant, vit-admin, tenant-admin
#   gps-ingest, ingest
#   all

SERVICES=tenant-admin
